              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 9:21",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "O ye ought to begin to howl and mourn, because of the great destruction which at this time doth await you, except ye shall repent.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 32,
            "end": 37,
            "text": "Ezek. 24:23; Mosiah 7:24."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 22,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Ezek. 24:23; Mosiah 7:24.",
            "prettyString": "Ezekiel 24:23; Mosiah 7:24",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "ezekiel",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 24,
                    "end": 24,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 23,
                        "end": 23
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "mosiah",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 7,
                    "end": 7,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 24,
                        "end": 24
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 9:22",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 22
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold ye say that I have agreed with a man that he should murder Seezoram, our chief judge. But behold, I say unto you, that this is because I have testified unto you that ye might know concerning this thing; yea, even for a witness unto you, that I did know of the wickedness and abominations which are among you.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 23,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 9:23",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 23
      },
      {
        "text": "And because I have done this, ye say that I have agreed with a man that he should do this thing; yea, because I showed unto you this sign ye are angry with me, and seek to destroy my life.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 24,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 9:24",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 24
      },
      {
        "text": "And now behold, I will show unto you another sign, and see if ye will in this thing seek to destroy me.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 25,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 9:25",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 25
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold I say unto you: Go to the house of Seantum, who is the brother of Seezoram, and say unto him—",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 62,
            "end": 69,
            "text": "Hel. 8:27."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 26,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Hel. 8:27.",
            "prettyString": "Helaman 8:27",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "helaman",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 8,
                    "end": 8,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 27,
                        "end": 27
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 9:26",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 26
      },
      {
        "text": "Has Nephi, the pretended prophet, who doth prophesy so much evil concerning this people, agreed with thee, in the which ye have murdered Seezoram, who is your brother?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 27,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 9:27",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 27
      },
      {
        "text": "And behold, he shall say unto you, Nay.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 28,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 9:28",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 28
      },
      {
        "text": "And ye shall say unto him: Have ye murdered your brother?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 29,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 9:29",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 29
      },
      {
        "text": "And he shall stand with fear, and wist not what to say. And behold, he shall deny unto you; and he shall make as if he were astonished; nevertheless, he shall declare unto you that he is innocent.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 30,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 9:30",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 30
      },
      {
        "text": "But behold, ye shall examine him, and ye shall find blood upon the skirts of his cloak.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 31,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 9:31",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 31
      },
      {
        "text": "And when ye have seen this, ye shall say: From whence cometh this blood? Do we not know that it is the blood of your brother?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 32,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 9:32",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 32
      },
      {
        "text": "And then shall he tremble, and shall look pale, even as if death had come upon him.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 33,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 9:33",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 33
      },
      {
        "text": "And then shall ye say: Because of this fear and this paleness which has come upon your face, behold, we know that thou art guilty.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 34,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 9:34",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 34
      },
      {
        "text": "And then shall greater fear come upon him; and then shall he confess unto you, and deny no more that he has done this murder.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 35,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 9:35",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 35
      },
      {
        "text": "And then shall he say unto you, that I, Nephi, know nothing concerning the matter save it were given unto me by the power of God. And then shall ye know that I am an honest man, and that I am sent unto you from God.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 36,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 9:36",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 36
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that they went and did, even according as Nephi had said unto them. And behold, the words which he had said were true; for according to the words he did deny; and also according to the words he did confess.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 37,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 9:37",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 37
      },
      {
